any topic you want for you.

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:07.689
They'll research any topic for you, so if
you have a topic so say, "Hey, I'm getting

00:03:07.689 --> 00:03:09.650
ready to negotiate with this company.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:12.989
What can you find our about this company,
or what can you find out about the real estate

00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:13.989
market today?

00:03:13.989 --> 00:03:15.430
What can you find out about Bitcoin today?

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.670
What can you find out about such and such
today?"

